    "scenesThatPass": [
      "KIM: Alright, let’s go.\nLANE: Running late.\nKIM: I’ll take the heat, don’t worry.\nLANE: Get all the samples you wanted?",
      "LANE: What’re you talking about?\nKIM: So what do you reckon? We get back home, we’re all gonna start painting pictures and writing poetry, like the Moon walkers.\nLANE: It changed them. They all said it.",
      "DALBY: Somebody’s coming in ...\nCLOSE ON DALBY: Her face a mask of terror ...",
      "LANE: Jesus, what’s happened to them!?\nKIM: You still don’t get it, do you. They’re dead!\nLANE: Crazy or dead, if they get through that door ...",
      "LANE: Get to the Rovers.\nKIM: Take too long to get through the airlocks. They’d be all over us."
    ]
